description:
1. Develop new and manage existing channel partners who are willing to sell the products and solutions by the instruction from headquarter;
2. Promote the Company branding with distributor and partners together;
3. Identify, recruit and on-board new channel partners to build business;
4. Coordinate with partners to identify new business opportunities for revenue generation;
5. Provide proposals, quotations and pricings to partners;
6. Develop profitable business model based on market trends and competitor activity;
7. Implement sales programs for product positioning and promotions;
8. Conduct business review with partners and recommend improvements;
9. Fulfill and act on verbal and/or written assignments, tasks, instructions and orders of immediate supervisors, other competent officials and authorized representatives of the Employer, should business needs so require, and, therefore, are deemed to be production assignments.

requirements:
1、酒店管理、旅游管理等相关专业优先；
2、沟通协调、抗压能力、学习意愿强，英语基础佳（通过英语四六级优先）;
3、接受基层锻炼，适应倒班或高强度工作。

description:
岗位职责:
1.负责电商平台活动策划、执行及优化，包括但不限于大促、日常促销、补贴活动等，提升用户活跃度及转化率;
2.深入理解电商运营逻辑，合理制定补贴策略，监控ROI、GMV、转化率等核心指标，确保活动效果;
3.独立完成活动主题、方案、策略、谈判等全流程的搭建与落地，协调设计、市场、运营等团队推进活动上线;
4.对运营数据进行监控与分析，通过数据化分析工具提取数据，定位问题并提出优化方案;
5.熟悉移动互联网产品逻辑及数据逻辑，能结合用户行为数据优化活动策略;
6.关注行业动态及竞品动向，持续迭代运营玩法，提升活动创新性及用户体验。
